Scraped from India Code handle 22078 — 104 sections. The Industrial Relations Code, 2020 consolidates Trade Unions Act 1926, Industrial Employment (Standing Orders) Act 1946, and Industrial Disputes Act 1947. Covers trade union registration, standing orders, notice of change, voluntary reference of disputes, worker re-skilling fund, strikes/lock-outs, unfair labour practices. 469KB structured JSON. Source: indiacode.nic.in.